WAL-FAST is a ground-up reimplementation in OCaml, inspired by the
design, language specification, and published academic work of the
original WAL project. No Python source code from the original project
was copied into this repository.

If you use WAL or WAL-FAST in academic work, please also cite:
  Miro Haller, Alois Schoepfl, Robert Koenig,
  "WAL: A Novel Language for Waveform Analysis",
  WOSET 2021.
